From e4ade304659f4941a6b8cb9b126aee65b1d8e400 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AbhishekPok <abhishekpokhrel001@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:31:50 +0545
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Idle services back off: 200 ms poll after 5 s quiet,
 NetworkManager link-only every 5 s

Service::listen backs off when nothing has written for 5 s; input, IPC and
dbus writes plus wake_pollers() (Workspaces, Audio) wake it again. Listener
threads are flagged so periodic listeners don't keep every poller awake.
Network polls link state every 5 s and fetches the AP list only while it
was read in the last 30 s (NetworkManager CPU down ~90%).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
